---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'March 2026';
---

<PageLayout title="Home" description="Native plant resources for the DC Metro area (DMV). Nurseries, plant swaps, landscaping companies, and everything you need to grow a garden that supports wildlife.">

<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-green-700 to-green-600 text-white -mt-24 pt-24 pb-16 sm:py-20 rounded-b-3xl sm:mx-auto max-w-6xl">
  <div class="container-narrow space-y-8">
    <!-- Welcome text -->
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight break-words">
        Welcome to<br/>NativePlantsDMV.com
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-xl text-green-100 max-w-lg mt-3">
        Your local resource for native plants in the DC Metro area. Nurseries, plant swaps, landscaping companies, and everything you need to grow a garden that supports wildlife.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-green-200 mt-2">
        Spring '26 Plant exchanges listed on our <a href="/events/" class="underline font-medium hover:text-white transition-colors">Current Events</a> page.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Butterfly/flower image -->
    <div class="flex justify-center">
      <img
        src="/images/butterfly-coneflowers.jpg"
        alt="Eastern Tiger Swallowtail butterfly on pink coneflowers"
        class="rounded-xl shadow-2xl w-full max-w-xs object-cover"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Yard signs section -->
    <div class="border-t border-green-500/30 pt-8">
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-6 flex-wrap mb-4">
        <img
          src="/images/coreopsis-bees.jpg"
          alt="Yellow coreopsis flowers with bees foraging"
          class="rounded-lg shadow-md max-w-xs w-full"
          loading="eager"
        />
        <img
          src="/images/yard-signs-combo.jpg"
          alt="Native Plants yard signs in residential garden"
          class="rounded-lg shadow-md max-w-xs w-full"
          loading="eager"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Native Plant Signs Available</h2>
        <p class="text-green-100 mb-2">$5 donation: pick up in Takoma Park, or delivery nearby</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-green-200">
          Contact for more information: <a href="mailto:kallen808@gmail.com" class="underline hover:text-white transition-colors">kallen808@gmail.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Why Native Plants -->
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <h2 class="section-title flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-3xl">🦋</span> Why Grow Native Plants?
    </h2>
    <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-700 max-w-3xl space-y-4">
      <p>
        Native plants are the foundation of local ecosystems. They evolved alongside regional insects, birds, and pollinators over thousands of years — creating relationships that non-native species simply can't replicate. A single mature native tree can support hundreds of caterpillar species, which in turn feed nesting songbirds.
      </p>
      <p>
        Planting natives means less watering, fewer pesticides, and more wildlife activity in your yard. It also helps combat habitat loss across the broader region — even small yards contribute to ecological corridors when planted thoughtfully.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6">
      <a href="/resources/#why-natives" class="btn-primary inline-block">Read More Resources →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Zoom Meetings -->
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-narrow max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="section-title flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl">
      <span class="text-3xl">☕</span> Join Our Zoom Meetings
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-green-800 mb-2">Climate Action Coffee</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-3">Weekly Zoom: Wednesday mornings 8:00 to 9:30 AM</p>
        <a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/88246766222?pwd=TzRPNkt0a09sbzRoMFpTdTZITU9ZZz09" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary text-sm">
          Join the Zoom
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-green-800 mb-2">The Pollinators</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-3">Every other Thursday morning by Zoom from 9:00 to 10:30 AM</p>
        <a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/88246766222?pwd=TzRPNkt0a09sbzRoMFpTdTZITU9ZZz09" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary text-sm">
          Join the Zoom
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4 text-sm">Learn more about our group on the <a href="/about/" class="resource-link">About Us</a> page.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Endorsed Nurseries -->
<section class="section bg-stone-50">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <h2 class="section-title flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-3xl">🌿</span> Our Top Native Nurseries
    </h2>

    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 max-w-3xl">These three sell only true natives — no cultivars. All come highly recommended.</p>

    <!-- Top 3 endorsed -->
    <div class="grid gap-6 max-w-3xl mb-8">
      <div class="card bg-white border-l-4 border-green-500 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-green-800">Bona Terra</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">(202) 507-9648</p>
        <a href="https://bonaterradc.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="resource-link text-sm">bonaterradc.com</a>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mt-2">The largest retail inventory of strictly native plants using restorative growing methods in the DC area.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card bg-white border-l-4 border-green-500 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-green-800">Chesapeake Natives</h3>
        <a href="http://chesapeakenatives.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="resource-link text-sm">chesapeakenatives.org</a>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mt-2">The gold standard for native plantings in MD. Only local ecotypes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card bg-white border-l-4 border-green-500 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-green-800">Earth Sangha Nursery</h3>
        <a href="https://www.earthsangha.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="resource-link text-sm">earthsangha.org</a>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mt-2">Nonprofit public charity based in DC. Ecological restoration as a form of socially engaged Buddhism.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center">
      <a href="/nurseries/" class="btn-primary inline-block">See Full Nursery Directory →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Quick Nav to Sub-pages -->
<section class="section bg-green-50">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <h2 class="section-title text-center">Explore More</h2>
    <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 max-w-4xl mx-auto" aria-label="Site sections">
      {[
        { label: '🌿 Nurseries', url: '/nurseries/', desc: 'Full directory of native plant vendors' },
        { label: '🏡 Landscapers', url: '/landscapers/', desc: 'Companies that use mostly natives' },
        { label: '🌳 Gardens to Visit', url: '/gardens-to-visit/', desc: 'Public gardens and arboretums' },
        { label: '📚 Resources', url: '/resources/', desc: 'Plant guides, ID apps, organizations' },
      ].map(item => (
        <a href={item.url} class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow block">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-green-700">{item.label}</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">{item.desc}</p>
        </a>
      ))}
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Bottom Contact -->
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-narrow text-center">
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 text-lg">Know other resources, or corrections needed?</p>
    <a href="mailto:kallen808@gmail.com" class="btn-primary">
      Email Ken &mdash; I'll take care of it soon.
    </a>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-4">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
  </div>
</section>

</PageLayout>
